<title>USA: CompUSA to open two new superstores.</title>
<headline>CompUSA to open two new superstores.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompUSA Inc said on Thursday it would open two new Computer Superstores in Alabama and Illinois on November 1.</p>
<p>A 26,100-square-foot store will open in Hoover, Ala., and a 25,000-square-foot store will open in Naperville, Ill.</p>
<p>The company currently operates 113 computer superstores in 52 metropolitan markets.</p>
